# welcome-loop-frames (H10): the welcome loop's key frames on the paused clock.
#
# Navigation-pinned mount: the viewer opens (default route), settles, then
# the wordmark click mounts the welcome page on the click frame on both
# sides (port and reference run the same script). The mount draws rest.
# Model loop_at values at each shot offset (port elapsed ~= script ms within
# a frame; first frame +16.67, then +16):
# +1000 x2 rest (a 1.00, k 0.00, b 1.00, h 0.00)
# +1800 x2 k -1.14 mid-drag
# +3300 x2 k -1.50, h 0.73 mid-drag
# +4500 sinx, 83 ms loop-time into the switch (x2 fading ~0.5, sinx drawing on)
# +4900 sinx, switch ~500 ms in (old gone, draw_to ~0.65)
# +6800 sinx a 2.36 mid-drag
# +8500 sinx a 3.00, k -0.37 dragging back
# +10200 sinx k 0.00, b 1.77 mid-drag
# +11450 x3, ~117 ms into the switch (sinx fading ~0.27, x3 drawing on)
# +13500 x3 h 0.22 mid-drag
# +14700 x2, ~117 ms into the switch (x3 fading, x2 drawing on)
# +16700 x2 a 1.26 mid-drag
# +18200 x2 a 1.00, b 1.16 mid-drag
# +18900 x2 rest (loop restarted at 18791.67)
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 104 48
shot loop-mount
wait 1000
shot loop-1000
wait 800
shot loop-1800
wait 1500
shot loop-3300
wait 1200
shot loop-4500
wait 400
shot loop-4900
wait 1900
shot loop-6800
wait 1700
shot loop-8500
wait 1700
shot loop-10200
wait 1250
shot loop-11450
wait 2050
shot loop-13500
wait 1200
shot loop-14700
wait 2000
shot loop-16700
wait 1500
shot loop-18200
wait 700
shot loop-18900
